** +20% Bonus Exotic Damage for 15 sec

When using Hull Healing Bridge Officer Abilities:&lt;br /&gt;
To up to 3 foes within 3km:&lt;br /&gt;
*X Radiation Damage every 1 sec for 5 sec&lt;br /&gt;
&#039;&#039;(100% Shield Penetration)&#039;&#039;

